994 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (ProductOps is controversial, but one thing is clear: teams waste a lot of time redoing work that has already been done in their company. This is especially true for new hires but also affects even experienced teammates. There are likely examples of previous interview scripts that could be reused or workshop agendas that could be duplicated. These files are hidden in the depths of company shared drives, and surfacing them requires knowing where to look. Additionally, there are many ideas that have likely already been tried before at companies and didn't work. What if anyone could tap into all that information quickly? That is the power of AI.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
