/ActualText (AI speeds up data analysis and improves accuracy. Before AI you had to comb through data by hand. Write SQL queries or excel macros. AI tools can analyze customer feedback, social media trends, and competitors in near real-time. Machine learning identifies patterns and predicts market trends, aiding decisions on product features, pricing, and positioning. )
