/ActualText (It is time to bring your ideas to life. To turn the sketches into visual dreams. In the Prototyping stage you explore design concepts, test functionality, and gather user feedback. Prototyping allows teams to visualize and interact with the product early on. You can identify potential issues before spending time on full-scale development. )
