<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2644 0 R
/ActualText (While there is certainly a time saving factor at play here, the bigger impact will likely be in improved reports. This will mean more smart projects will be greenlit. And more respect will fall on product teams.)
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [3]
>>
