<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1 in every 6 people in the world has a significant disability, and the majority of them use the internet. Unfortunately, many websites do not allow them to browse easily. In many cases, this exposes companies to lawsuits for not supporting accessibility standards. AI can assist us in checking our designs and websites to ensure that they meet accessibility standards. Additionally, AI systems can proactively update websites to make them accessible.)
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
