/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (There is a battle going on for the top AI assistant on code writing between Cursor, GitHub Co-pilot and Supermaven. As of writing, I am seeing the most love from engineers on Cursor. I think the ability to have inline AI-powered autocomplete, help with documentation, automated test writing and then just general help on engineering is an absolute gamechanger. We have seen that AI coding assistants are not great at writing novel code, but can help with the smaller tasks that engineers end up doing frequently. I look forward to a healthy competition here for co-pilots on writing code )
/Pg 76 0 R
/K [4]
>>
