/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A buggy product is not good. It erodes user trust. Hurts the experience. And can result in customer churn. The Testing stage involves testing the product in different ways, such as unit testing, integration testing, system testing, and user acceptance testing. The goal is to identify and fix defects, verify performance, and ensure the product is ready for release. )
/Pg 80 0 R
/K [2]
>>
