<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2725 0 R
/ActualText (False Positives/Negatives: AI may incorrectly identify bugs or miss critical issues, leading to unreliable test results.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2726 0 R
/ActualText (Complexity in Debugging: AI-generated test cases and results can be difficult to interpret and debug.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [6]
>>
