1726 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I think one of the biggest wins for engineers will be having AI handle more and more automated tests. AI should easily be able to write both unit and integration tests and ensure deployments properly pass these test cases. Test sigma is focused on solving this problem. It is already good and I expect it will improve dramatically in the coming months and years because they are so hyper focused on solving that problem. )
/Pg 87 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
