/ActualText (The outputs of GenAI are only as good as the data it is trained on. Poor quality or biased data can lead to flawed or biased outputs. This has a number of ethical considerations such as perpetuating stereotypes. Not good and a significant risk as AI gets integrated into more tools.)
/Pg 105 0 R
/K [2]
>>
