<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Experimentation is the key to success. This is true in both developing products as well as the process itself. Fail fast! And learn from it. Encourage teams to explore new ideas and experiment with different approaches. Here are three strategies to build the experimentation muscle:)
