1989 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As I write this closing chapter, Apple is dropping their much anticipated AI play, Apple Intelligence. The space is moving FAST. Every day new tools are launched. New groundbreaking models are revealed by the research companies.)
/Pg 114 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1990 0 obj
<<
